orders.nonGoals:
carrying or reusing task results across identities; input
binding; a time-budgeted selection; splitting any suite other than
launchpad; target gates (`scripts/lib/target-gate.mjs`); `gate-deadlines.mjs`;
plain `npm test` composition (WO-186); `worktree publish` and release close;
reviews, findings and worker caps; minting a role oracle or a feedback
edition from the sync command.

events; re-reading a target repository at `index --check`;
console v1; drag-equip authoring; any other panel; a new schema field; the
real run (WO-083); runtime transports as executors.

moving any instance content to core; reading or tracking an
instance from core; any row about a real predecessor in this repository;
reading or importing predecessor material; a tracker other than the forge's
issues, or an adapter for any tracker (an instance's adapter is WO-207's
extension point); automation that writes to an issue after it is filed;
deciding policy for any host; deciding what an instance may retire.
